! SEED=1
! GAME=../entharion/dialog-code/picture-test.aastory

# A resource test on the frame of Cloak of Darkness, played to its
# winning ending. The point of it is the opening: the game embeds a
# picture, and a stream of text has nowhere to put one, so what comes
# out is the alternative text the story carries for it. That is the
# resource path exercised in play rather than in isolation.

x me
x cloak
n
w
hang cloak on hook
e
s
x message
quit
